Fenwater now validates three treasure payloads through `TreasureParcelTemplateSchema.parse(...)` and has three `safeHaven` components:

- Alder Knoll dry camp
- Reedwright stove boat
- Pump House mezzanine

Reviewer findings were fixed before push:

- lifecycle state is `recovered_to_safety` instead of vague `recovered`;
- player-facing treasure visibility rejects `referee_private` and `audience_xray`;
- rule supplement schema now models temporary/campaign/module/citation shape better.

### Review tools

- Macroscope was reinstalled manually after its self-update deleted the binary.
- `macroscope codereview --in-place --base HEAD` ran and produced three valid Worker findings. Fixed:
  - null/undefined opening strings no longer coerce to literal `""`;
  - combat `modelCallsUsed` counts tactic calls, not full party length;
  - locked exploration action counts one model call instead of two.
- CodeRabbit was available but timed out; surfaced one unrelated Brain duplicate-step nit only.

### Runtime hardening deployed, not committed

`apps/worker/src/index.ts` currently has local hardening/UI changes:

- `waitStatus` on Town Module Table state:
  - `phase`
